Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:49:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(2d): keep default ramp entries independent of link
 angles

Use the 3 degree entry default for Inside Contour and shared ring ramp
fallbacks when no entry angle is set. Pin the three affected operations
and preserve explicit entry and level transition angles.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1674
